//twitter.com/rei_software/status/1455965882258124801\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"おたま","author_subname":"@UG18353762","author_link":"https://twitter.com/UG18353762/status/1456200045183873026","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1327813742977957888/_T03pMHp_normal.jpg","text":"多分違う。その理屈なら瓶詰めでも同様に黒変することになるが、数10年ものの手作りのシロップ漬け果実の瓶詰めが物置とか床下から発掘されて、見た感じ大丈夫そうだったり食べてみたら(!?)何ともなかったという話はよくある。黒変は缶詰では起こるが、瓶詰めは長期保存で深い琥珀色で甘さが残る。 \u003chttps://twitter.com/rei_software/status/1455965882258124801\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1636020120,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/UG18353762/status/1456200045183873026?t=cBr7_ZwQT-SiDKmeAapS9g\u0026amp;s=19","original_url":"https://twitter.com/UG18353762/status/1456200045183873026?t=cBr7_ZwQT-SiDKmeAapS9g\u0026amp;s=19"},{"color":"32BBF3","fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/rei_software|@rei_software\u003e: まぁそういうわけで、多分、シロップの分解による炭化。炭なので食っても多分大丈夫。\n栄養価は…","id":2,"author_name":"れい(アマチュア)","author_subname":"@rei_software","author_link":"https://twitter.com/rei_software/status/1455965882258124801","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/883085228381577216/mdtGRjZp_normal.jpg","text":"まぁそういうわけで、多分、シロップの分解による炭化。炭なので食っても多分大丈夫。\n栄養価は…","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1635964291,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/rei_software/status/1455965882258124801"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VmHYH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca8697bb-0c3c-4fcf-8c01-66b1ff7475c2","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"（まあこういう噛み付き方してくる人はちょっと…て感じですよね）","ts":"1636299856.077500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5i/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2efa3f64-412b-4861-8fb0-fa1da8bff94d","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"こっちのスレも面白いので貼っておく\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/rei_software/status/1457360355525423104?t=j789-BmltBPC3jslVztSeA\u0026amp;s=19|https://twitter.com/rei_software/status/1457360355525423104?t=j789-BmltBPC3jslVztSeA\u0026amp;s=19\u003e","ts":"1636299822.076600","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/rei_software|@rei_software\u003e: こっちにつなげておく。\n缶詰に残った酸素が問題では？\nということなので、\n\n計算してみる。\n\nつづく。\n\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/marsh3na/status/1457349762601013255?s=20\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"れい(アマチュア)","author_subname":"@rei_software","author_link":"https://twitter.com/rei_software/status/1457360355525423104","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/883085228381577216/mdtGRjZp_normal.jpg","text":"こっちにつなげておく。\n缶詰に残った酸素が問題では？\nということなので、\n\n計算してみる。\n\nつづく。\n\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/marsh3na/status/1457349762601013255?s=20\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1636296759,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/rei_software/status/1457360355525423104?t=j789-BmltBPC3jslVztSeA\u0026amp;s=19","original_url":"https://twitter.com/rei_software/status/1457360355525423104?t=j789-BmltBPC3jslVztSeA\u0026amp;s=19"},{"color":"32BBF3","fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/marsh3na|@marsh3na\u003e: \u003chttps://twitter.com/rei_software|@rei_software\u003e 化学と生物は、どれだけお詳しいですか？\n\n穴の大きさの定義は？\n\nあのですね。\n\n今回の缶詰の反応は、缶詰を作る時に入ってしまった微量の溶存酸素と。\n\nその微量な溶存酸素で、缶詰の中で酸化鉄が出来て、水素イオンも出来た結果なので。\n\n貴方が言われた穴など関係無いのです。","id":2,"author_name":"M’s Farm","author_subname":"@marsh3na","author_link":"https://twitter.com/marsh3na/status/1457349762601013255","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1137989771500826624/GByM4qAe_normal.jpg","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/rei_software|@rei_software\u003e 化学と生物は、どれだけお詳しいですか？\n\n穴の大きさの定義は？\n\nあのですね。\n\n今回の缶詰の反応は、缶詰を作る時に入ってしまった微量の溶存酸素と。\n\nその微量な溶存酸素で、缶詰の中で酸化鉄が出来て、水素イオンも出来た結果なので。\n\n貴方が言われた穴など関係無いのです。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1636294234,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/marsh3na/status/1457349762601013255"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JJgRs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"710aa048-2c24-4b9b-a60e-a9c221703844","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"手元にない現象について断定口調で書いてるのがまずちょっとアレ\nそもそもの関わり始めに「墨混ぜたんでしょ」から来てるのがかなりアレ","ts":"1636299112.075400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U02G79NJMLY"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vv8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99afb57b-3946-4b80-8257-e9eb01038d8a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"bio見たらあーうんってなった","ts":"1636298961.073500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"orTRF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56bf1e31-6d64-4eba-9a5d-89d7065a9c89","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"この人（理由を色々書いてる人）、言葉遣いとかちょっとアレだなあという感","ts":"1636298858.073200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WT=4F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f78feb3a-7fd7-4636-a097-8de5efbc9106","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"続報っぽい。\n\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/marsh3na/status/1456702071487352832\u003e","ts":"1636297613.071800","thread_ts":"1635988933.066400","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/marsh3na|@marsh3na\u003e: 本件のフルーツポンチの炭化現象は、当初、炭を入れたのでは無いかと言う私の推測は、誤りでした。\n数日調査した結果。\n\n\u003chttps://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/tetsutohagane1955/73/3/73_3_427/_pdf\u003e\n\n缶詰の炭化は、ブリキの錫を消費した結果の鉄の溶出によるガルバニック反応からの電気エネルギーによる電池反応の酸化還元反応でした。 \u003chttps://twitter.com/chestnut100kg/status/1455504841233424384\u003e \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FDc-zwgaQAIPwmS.jpg\u003e","id"